{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103742","id":2377613466,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Nt4Ca","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103742","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103742.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103742.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103742","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103742/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103742/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103742/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2ac01c189d0b46d4f5dec05a5d9b25e5b91ca291","number":103742,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Change the random pitch on the audio stream randomizer to be in semitones, not a frequency multiplier. ","user":{"login":"RoyBerardo","id":32561682,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTYxNjgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32561682?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo","html_url":"https://github.com/RoyBerardo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Currently, the value for the audio stream's random pitch is represented as a frequency multiplier. This has two issues:\r\n\r\n- This is a non-linear scale, so changes near 0 have dramatic effect, while changes far from 0 have diminishing returns. This can make it tricky to \"dial-in\" subtle pitch randomization, and is also arguably strange from a UX perspective. To set the range to approximately one semi-tone, the value needs to be 1.06, which is a subtle difference on the current 1-16 scale.\r\n- As mentioned in [this proposal](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/10238), the current system is biased towards picking higher-pitched random pitches.\r\n\r\nBy switching to using semitones for this value, it becomes easier to dial in subtle changes. In addition, since it is a linear system, the random pitch selection isn't biased.\r\n\r\nThis all being said, this update would cause issues when upgrading from an earlier engine version. Any values used in the randomizer would need to be re-entered, and code that sets or gets the random values would need to be updated (it could be useful to have functions like freq_to_semitone() and semitone_to_freq() for easy converting between the two.)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":